{'symbol': 'WMT', 'date': '2022-04-27 10:35:00', 'title': 'BIMBO BAKERIES USA JOINS WALMART FOR ITS NINTH ANNUAL “FIGHT HUNGER. SPARK CHANGE.', 'text': 'HORSHAM, PA., APRIL 27, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BIMBO BAKERIES USA, INC. IS TEAMING UP WITH WALMART FOR ITS 2022 “FIGHT HUNGER. SPARK CHANGE.” CAMPAIGN. NOW IN ITS NINTH YEAR, THE CAMPAIGN WORKS WITH LOCAL FEEDING AMERICA® FOOD BANKS TO HELP SECURE MEALS FOR THOSE FACING FOOD INSECURITY.'}